id: pm-gh1597
title: "GH-1597: expose host-bound item transaction status and safe abandonment or supersession"
description: "GitHub https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1597 requests public recovery for interrupted item-mutation journals when a peer edit changes the retry plan. Existing bulk commit and guarded compensation are shipped; extend their public host-bound lifecycle rather than duplicating private journal storage or reviving completed implementation."
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 1
